Thanks for taking the SCOPE. You are on your way to making the right choice=
 for your future career. Click or tap the button below to get your complete=
 SCOPE results which includes details on your secondary personality types, =
recommended careers, and a
<strong>FREE Career Planning Worksheet</strong> to help you in your <strong=
